{"id":"16a6071f8070de5d","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-shattering-family.md","title":"ZFC Shattering Family","display":"df-zfc-shattering-family — ZFC Shattering Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-shattering-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-shattering-family"],"display":"df-zfc-shattering-family — ZFC Shattering Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-splitting-real]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-shattering-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-shattering-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-shattering-family — ZFC Shattering Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97877ee11b1b05a4\" href=\"?note=97877ee11b1b05a4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-splitting-real\">58-df-zfc-splitting-real</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99a7a09e1b39c781\" href=\"?note=99a7a09e1b39c781\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator\">58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal{S}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> (family of subsets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99a7a09e1b39c781\" href=\"?note=99a7a09e1b39c781\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator\">58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span> 使用下列恰可数无限子集的集合公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShatteringFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ShatteringFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\">\\([A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}shattering\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShatteringFamily}_S(\\mathcal{S}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal{S}\\subseteq\\mathcal{P}(\\omega)\\land\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists Y\\in\\mathcal{S}\\;(|X\\cap Y|=\\aleph_0\\land|X\\setminus Y|=\\aleph_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}shattering\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShatteringFamily}_S(\\mathcal{S}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal{S}\\subseteq\\mathcal{P}(\\omega)\\land\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists Y\\in\\mathcal{S}\\;(|X\\cap Y|=\\aleph_0\\land|X\\setminus Y|=\\aleph_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This historical &quot;shattering&quot; label denotes the standard splitting-family property; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> is used for a family member to avoid collision with a logical signature symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-splitting-real","status":"resolved","id":"97877ee11b1b05a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-splitting-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator","status":"resolved","id":"99a7a09e1b39c781","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator","status":"resolved","id":"99a7a09e1b39c781","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"